<title>UK: Bankinter sets 10 bln peseta 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bankinter sets 10 bln peseta 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO INTERCONTINENTAL ESPANOL SA</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTA    COUPON     6.95	MATURITY    16.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    16.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  45 BP     LISTING    AIAF	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
